  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Technical Assistance to the Office of National Authorising Officer for EDF (NAO) in Developing Tender Dossier to Facilitate Procurement of Technical Experts for Implementation of the Programme of Integrated Approach to Sustainable Cooking Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective to which this action contributes is to assist the Office of National Authorising Officer for EDF (NAO) in developing guideline for grant applicants for call for proposal (CfP) and relevant tender dossiers for procurement of experts to implement expected output 1.1 and output 2.2 in accordance with EU procurement guideline/procedures as foreseen in the Financing Agreement for the programme of Integrated Approach to Sustainable Cooking Solutions.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
